{"id": "SSC-2023-DHA-MATH-CQ-01", "exam": "SSC", "year": 2023, "board": "Dhaka", "subject": "General Mathematics", "subject_code": "109", "paper": null, "set": "Ka", "q_type": "CQ", "question_no": 1, "marks": 10.0, "stem": "$U = \\{x \\in \\mathbb{N} : x \\le 7\\}$, $A = \\{x \\in \\mathbb{N} : x \\text{ মৌলিক সংখ্যা এবং } x \\le 7\\}$ এবং $B = \\{x \\in \\mathbb{N} : x \\text{ বিজোড় সংখ্যা এবং } x \\le 7\\}$। একটি ফাংশন $f(y) = \\frac{y^3 + ky^2 - 4y - 8}{y - 2}$।", "has_image": false, "image_paths": [], "sub_parts": [{"part": "ক", "cognitive_domain": "knowledge", "marks": 2, "text_bn": "$A$ সেটটিকে তালিকা পদ্ধতিতে প্রকাশ কর।", "text_en": "Express set A in roster form.", "chapter_id": "MATH-CH02", "topic_id": "MATH-CH02-TOP01"}, {"part": "খ", "cognitive_domain": "comprehension", "marks": 4, "text_bn": "প্রমাণ কর যে, $(A \\cup B)' = A' \\cap B'$।", "text_en": "Prove that (A U B)' = A' ∩ B'.", "chapter_id": "MATH-CH02", "topic_id": "MATH-CH02-TOP01"}, {"part": "গ", "cognitive_domain": "application", "marks": 4, "text_bn": "$k$ এর মান কত হলে $f(2) = 0$ হবে তা নির্ণয় কর।", "text_en": "Find the value of k for which f(2) = 0.", "chapter_id": "MATH-CH02", "topic_id": "MATH-CH02-TOP02"}], "chapter_id": "MATH-CH02", "chapter_name_bn": "সেট ও ফাংশন", "chapter_name_en": "Sets and Functions", "topic_id": "MATH-CH02-TOP01", "topic_tags": ["তালিকা পদ্ধতি", "ডি মরগানের সূত্র", "ফাংশনের মান"], "bloom_level": "mixed", "curriculum_phase": "covid_short_2022_2023", "source_url": "https://dhakaeducationboard.gov.bd/ssc2023", "ocr_confidence": 0.99, "verification_status": "gold_verified", "annotator_id": "expert_01"}
{"id": "SSC-2022-RAJ-MATH-CQ-02", "exam": "SSC", "year": 2022, "board": "Rajshahi", "subject": "General Mathematics", "subject_code": "109", "paper": null, "set": "Ka", "q_type": "CQ", "question_no": 2, "marks": 10.0, "stem": "$x^2 - 3 = 2\\sqrt{2}$ এবং $p^3 + \\frac{1}{p^3} = 18\\sqrt{3}$ দুটি বীজগাণিতিক তথ্য।", "has_image": false, "image_paths": [], "sub_parts": [{"part": "ক", "cognitive_domain": "knowledge", "marks": 2, "text_bn": "উৎপাদকে বিশ্লেষণ কর: $4a^2 - 12ab + 9b^2 - 16c^2$।", "text_en": "Factorize: 4a^2 - 12ab + 9b^2 - 16c^2.", "chapter_id": "MATH-CH03", "topic_id": "MATH-CH03-TOP02"}, {"part": "খ", "cognitive_domain": "comprehension", "marks": 4, "text_bn": "$x^5 + \\frac{1}{x^5}$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর।", "text_en": "Find the value of x^5 + 1/x^5.", "chapter_id": "MATH-CH03", "topic_id": "MATH-CH03-TOP01"}, {"part": "গ", "cognitive_domain": "application", "marks": 4, "text_bn": "প্রমাণ কর যে, $p = \\sqrt{3} + \\sqrt{2}$।", "text_en": "Prove that p = sqrt(3) + sqrt(2).", "chapter_id": "MATH-CH03", "topic_id": "MATH-CH03-TOP01"}], "chapter_id": "MATH-CH03", "chapter_name_bn": "বীজগাণিতিক রাশি", "chapter_name_en": "Algebraic Expressions", "topic_id": "MATH-CH03-TOP01", "topic_tags": ["বর্গ ও ঘনের সূত্র", "মান নির্ণয়", "উৎপাদক"], "bloom_level": "mixed", "curriculum_phase": "covid_short_2022_2023", "source_url": "https://rajshahieducationboard.gov.bd/ssc2022", "ocr_confidence": 0.99, "verification_status": "gold_verified", "annotator_id": "expert_02"}
